OL,3,GNEWSASection of M1 closed following
OL,4,A'serious collision'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA section of the M1 has been closed
OL,7,Ffollowing a "serious collision",
OL,8,FNational Highways has said.
OL,10,FThe authority said at 18:38 BST that
OL,11,Fthe northbound carriageway was closed
OL,12,Fbetween J23 and J23A near Loughborough.
OL,14,FDelays of an hour are being reported on
OL,15,Fapproach to the crash, it added.
OL,17,FDrivers are being urged to allow extra
OL,18,Ftravel time for their journeys.
